#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration, Drivers and Additional Packages"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo, Controladores e Pacotes Adicionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid "Scanning devices"
msgstr "Dispositivos de digitalização"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To access your scanner, you will probably need the related kernel drivers "
"and/or additional support packages. A SCSI scanner will need SCSI drivers, a"
" parallel port scanner needs parallel port support (you should use enhanced "
"EPP modes) and perhaps <ulink "
"url=\"http://cyberelk.net/tim/libieee1284/\">libieee1284</ulink>, and a USB "
"scanner will need the <xref linkend=\"libusb\"/> package. For HP devices, "
"you may need <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/hplip/files/hplip/\">hplip</ulink>.  "
"Ensure you have the necessary drivers properly configured to access the "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Para acessar tua digitalizadora, você provavelmente precisará dos "
"controladores de núcleo relacionados e (ou) pacotes adicionais de suporte. "
"Uma digitalizadora SCSI precisará de controladores SCSI; uma digitalizadora "
"de porta paralela precisa de suporte a porta paralela (você deveria usar "
"modos EPP aprimorados) e talvez <ulink "
"url=\"http://cyberelk.net/tim/libieee1284/\">libieee1284</ulink>, e uma "
"digitalizadora USB precisará do pacote <xref linkend=\"libusb\"/>. Para "
"dispositivos HP, você possivelmente precise do <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/hplip/files/hplip/\">hplip</ulink>. "
"Certifique-se de ter os controladores necessários configurados corretamente "
"para acessar os dispositivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SANE"
msgstr "Instalação do SANE"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SANE Backends"
msgstr "Instalação do SANE Backends"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>SANE</application> daemon should run with its own group.  "
"Create this group by issuing the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"O processo de segundo plano do <application>SANE</application> deveria "
"executar com o próprio grupo dele. Crie esse grupo emitindo o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>groupadd -g 70 scanner</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>groupadd -g 70 scanner</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>configure</command> assumes that the user building "
"<application>SANE</application> Backends is a member of the <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> group for testing the existence of "
"this group. As a result, the user building the package needs to be added to "
"the <systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> group. Add the user"
" to the <systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> group by "
"issuing the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"<command>configure</command> assume que o(a) usuário(a) construindo "
"estruturas de retaguarda do <application>SANE</application> é um(a) "
"membro(a) do grupo <systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> para"
" testar a existência desse grupo. Como resultado, o(a) usuário(a) "
"construindo o pacote precisa ser adicionado(a) ao grupo <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem>. Adicione o(a) usuário(a) ao grupo "
"<systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> emitindo o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:199
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>usermod -G scanner -a "
"<replaceable>username</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>usermod -G scanner -a "
"<replaceable>nome_usuário(a)</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"After adding the <systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> group "
"as above, you will need to log out and back in to activate it."
msgstr ""
"Depois de adicionar o grupo <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> como acima, você precisará sair e "
"entrar novamente para ativá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For a USB scanner, if you are linking to <xref linkend=\"libusb\"/>, include"
" the configure switch --enable-libusb_1_0. Install "
"<application>SANE</application> Backends by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para uma digitalizadora USB, se você estiver vinculando ao <xref "
"linkend=\"libusb\"/>, inclua a chave de configuração --enable-libusb_1_0. "
"Instale as estruturas de retaguarda do <application>SANE</application> "
"executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:215
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sg scanner -c \"                                 \\\n"
"PYTHON=python3 ./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"                           --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"                           --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"                           --with-lockdir=/run/lock \\\n"
"                           --docdir=/usr/share/doc/sane-backends-&sane-version;\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sg scanner -c \"                                 \\\n"
"PYTHON=python3 ./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"                           --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"                           --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"                           --with-lockdir=/run/lock \\\n"
"                           --docdir=/usr/share/doc/sane-backends-&sane-version;\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:231
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -m 644 -v tools/udev/libsane.rules           \\\n"
"                  /etc/udev/rules.d/65-scanner.rules &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -p          /run/lock/sane &amp;&amp;\n"
"chgrp -v scanner  /run/lock/sane</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -m 644 -v tools/udev/libsane.rules           \\\n"
"                  /etc/udev/rules.d/65-scanner.rules &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -p          /run/lock/sane &amp;&amp;\n"
"chgrp -v scanner  /run/lock/sane</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"With the scanner on, run <command>scanimage -L</command> and the name and "
"location of the device should appear. Of course, you need the device drivers"
" configured, in order to run this test."
msgstr ""
"Com a digitalizadora ligada, execute <command>scanimage -L</command> e o "
"nome e local do dispositivo deveriam aparecer. Claro, você precisa dos "
"controladores de dispositivo configurados para a finalidade de executar esse"
" teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sg scanner -c \"...\"</command>: runs the command between double "
"quotes with principal group <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem>. This may be needed if the user has"
" been newly added to group scanner, and has not logged out and in."
msgstr ""
"<command>sg scanner -c \"...\"</command>: executa o comando entre aspas "
"duplas com o grupo principal <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem>. Isso possivelmente seja necessário"
" se o(a) usuário(a) tiver sido adicionado(a) recentemente ao grupo scanner e"
" não tiver feito logout e login."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:317
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>PYTHON=python3</parameter>: This switch forces the build system "
"to use Python 3 instead of Python 2."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>PYTHON=python3</parameter>: Essa chave força o sistema de "
"construção a usar Python 3 em vez de Python 2."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:322
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: This switch installs the "
"configuration files in <filename class=\"directory\">/etc/sane.d</filename> "
"instead of <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/etc/sane.d</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: Essa chave instala os arquivos de "
"configuração em <filename class=\"directory\">/etc/sane.d</filename> em vez "
"de <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/etc/sane.d</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:340
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring SANE"
msgstr "Configurando o SANE"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:343
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:346
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/sane.d/*.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/sane.d/*.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:350
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/sane.d/*.conf"
msgstr "/etc/sane.d/*.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:356
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:359
#, xml-text
msgid "Backend Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração da Estrutura de Retaguarda"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:362
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The backend configuration files are located in <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc/sane.d</filename>. Information for configuring the "
"various backends can be found by using the man(5)  page for the desired "
"backend. Run <command> man "
"sane-<replaceable>&lt;backend&gt;</replaceable></command>, substituting the "
"desired backend."
msgstr ""
"Os arquivos de configuração de estrutura de retaguarda estão localizados em "
"<filename class='directory'>/etc/sane.d</filename>. Informações para "
"configurar as várias estruturas de retaguarda podem ser encontradas usando-"
"se a página de manual(5) para a estrutura de retaguarda desejada. Execute "
"<command>man sane-<replaceable>&lt;estrutura de "
"retaguarda&gt;</replaceable></command>, substituindo a estrutura de "
"retaguarda desejada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:372
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Add any users that will use a scanner to the <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem> group."
msgstr ""
"Adicione quaisquer usuários(as) que usarão uma escaneadora ao grupo "
"<systemitem class=\"groupname\">scanner</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:378
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you plan on using the scanner client <xref linkend=\"simple-scan\"/> to "
"access a networked scanner such as an \"All-in-One\" printer/scanner, there "
"may be no configuration necessary. Try that first."
msgstr ""
"Se você planeja usar o cliente escaneador <xref linkend=\"simple-scan\"/> "
"para acessar um escaneador na rede de intercomunicação, como uma "
"impressora/escaneadora multifuncional, possivelmente nenhuma configuração "
"seja necessária. Tente isso primeiro."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:386
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to access a network scanner, include two lines in "
"<filename>net.conf</filename>, as the &root; user (make sure to replace "
"&lt;server_ip&gt; by the actual value):"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser acessar uma digitalizadora na rede de intercomunicação, "
"inclua duas linhas em <filename>net.conf</filename>, como usuário(a) &root; "
"(certifique-se de substituir &lt;ip_servidor&gt; pelo valor atual):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:391
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sane.d/net.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>connect_timeout = 60\n"
"&lt;server_ip&gt;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sane.d/net.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>connect_timeout = 60\n"
"&lt;ip_servidor&gt;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:397
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On the server side, include the client ip in the access list of "
"<filename>/etc/sane.d/saned.conf</filename>, restart the "
"<command>saned</command> daemon, and make sure the firewall, if any, is open"
" to the client."
msgstr ""
"No lado do servidor, inclua o IP do cliente na lista de acesso de "
"<filename>/etc/sane.d/saned.conf</filename>, reinicie o processo de segundo "
"plano <command>saned</command> e certifique-se de que o firewall, se houver,"
" está aberto ao cliente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:435
#, xml-text
msgid "General Information"
msgstr "Informação Geral"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:438
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For general information about configuring and using "
"<application>SANE</application>, see <command>man sane</command>.  For "
"information about USB scanning devices, run <command>man sane-usb</command>."
" For information about SCSI devices, run <command>man sane-scsi</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para informações gerais acerca de como configurar e usar o "
"<application>SANE</application>, veja-se <command>man sane</command>. Para "
"informações acerca de dispositivos USB de digitalização, execute "
"<command>man sane-usb</command>. Para informações relativas a dispositivos "
"SCSI, execute <command>man sane-scsi</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:448
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration and setup of the 'saned' daemon"
msgstr "Configuração e instalação do processo de segundo plano 'saned'"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/scanning/sane.xml:451
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>saned</command> daemon is not meant to be used for untrusted "
"clients. You should provide <xref linkend=\"fw-firewall\"/> protection to "
"ensure only trusted clients access the daemon. Due to the complex security "
"requirements to ensure only trusted clients access the daemon, BLFS does not"
" provide instructions to configure the <command>saned</command> daemon.  "
"Some good (but outdated)  information for setting up and securing the "
"<command>saned</command> daemon can be found at <ulink "
"url=\"https://penguin-breeder.org/sane/saned/\"/>."
msgstr ""
"O processo de segundo plano <command>saned</command> não é destinado a ser "
"usado por clientes não confiáveis. Você deveria fornecer proteção <xref "
"linkend=\"fw-firewall\"/> para garantir que somente clientes confiáveis "
"acessem o processo de segundo plano. Devido aos complexos requisitos de "
"segurança para garantir que somente clientes confiáveis acessem o processo "
"de segundo plano, o BLFS não fornece instruções para configurar o processo "
"de segundo plano <command>saned</command>. Algumas informações boas (mas "
"desatualizadas) para configurar e proteger o processo de segundo plano "
"<command>saned</command> podem ser encontradas em <ulink "
"url=\"https://penguin-breeder.org/sane/saned/\"/>."

